        {
          "text": "Na Yeova amwĩa, Nĩnĩw’ĩte kũvoya kwaku na kwĩsũvana kwaku, kũla wĩsũvanĩte mbee wakwa: nĩnĩvathĩte nyũmba ĩno yĩthĩwe ntheu, ĩla wakĩte, nĩkalye syĩtwa yakwa vo tene na tene; na metho makwa na ngoo yakwa ikeethĩwa vo ĩndĩ yonthe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
