        },
        {
          "text": "syana syoo ila syatialile ĩtina woo nthĩ ĩsu, ila ana ma Isilaeli mataatonya kwimina vyũ, imwe sya isu Solomoni asyumisye sya kũtethethaw’a wĩa wa ũkombo kũvika ũmũnthĩ. ",
